{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Passenger 23</strong> <strong>is a horror game centered around a student working at a rest stop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first shift is about to begin, and what awaits you is far more terrifying than you ever imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/6.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traces of the Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">23 passengers and a dark secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/1.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Midnight Visitor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The answers are dark, the questions even darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/2.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your shift has started!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter what happens late into the night, you must keep making sales, keep the place clean, and continue selling tokens for passengers headed to the restroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/7.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Story:</strong> As tension and secrets escalate over time, a seemingly ordinary night shift turns into a deadly adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival and Exploration:</strong> Restore the power, uncover strange notes, and steer clear of the looming threats around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tense Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in an intense setting filled with darkness, solitude, and the eerie vibes of a rest stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspired by a True Story:</strong> As the secrets of a 10-year-old accident come to light, you\u2019ll face the dark side of justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Graphics:</strong> Enjoy a nostalgic horror experience through PS1-style low-resolution aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Turkish and English Support:</strong> Experience the full depth of the story in both languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2369810?t=1741910468","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2369810?t=1741910468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/ed5463db0045a7baa448472a77f5423ea30065ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741910468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/ed5463db0045a7baa448472a77f5423ea30065ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741910468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Passenger 23</strong> <strong>is a horror game centered around a student working at a rest stop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first shift is about to begin, and what awaits you is far more terrifying than you ever imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/6.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traces of the Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">23 passengers and a dark secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/1.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Midnight Visitor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The answers are dark, the questions even darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/2.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your shift has started!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter what happens late into the night, you must keep making sales, keep the place clean, and continue selling tokens for passengers headed to the restroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369810/extras/7.gif?t=1741910468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Story:</strong> As tension and secrets escalate over time, a seemingly ordinary night shift turns into a deadly adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival and Exploration:</strong> Restore the power, uncover strange notes, and steer clear of the looming threats around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tense Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in an intense setting filled with darkness, solitude, and the eerie vibes of a rest stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspired by a True Story:</strong> As the secrets of a 10-year-old accident come to light, you\u2019ll face the dark side of justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Graphics:</strong> Enjoy a nostalgic horror experience through PS1-style low-resolution aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Turkish and English Support:</strong> Experience the full depth of the story in both languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["IGNUS NEX ENTERTAINMENT"],"genres":[{